RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those 75 years. In 2025, August to September ran 56% of normal on the middle, after June to July ran 141% in 2025. Grid 22104 had its driest year in 1963 at 67% of normal.</p>"}
